float64 duration_s
---
bool success
string message
float64 time_s
float64 waited_s
# The episode budget in seconds of world time, as the world supplies it: used_s consumed (it may include
# initialization, so it can differ from time_s) and max_s allowed (inf: no cap). Both are NaN without a budget.
float64 used_s
float64 max_s
